     <P> </P>
<P>各位老师：</P>
<P>2019年浙派名师名校长培养工程现已启动报名。根据文件要求，经学校讨论，学校将推荐化学、政治和信息技术三个学科各1人。请有意报名的老师参照通知准备相关材料，并于4月28日之前将材料交到教科室。</P>
<P><FONT size=5>附件点此下载：</FONT><A title=申报材料 href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201904/2019042415325220.rar"><FONT size=5>申报材料</FONT></A></P>
<P> </P>
<P class=16 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: "方正小标宋简体",serif; mso-hansi-font-family: Verdana'>关于做好<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年中小学教师省级有关培训项目工作的通知</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 22.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "方正小标宋简体",serif; mso-hansi-font-family: Verdana'><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>各区、县（市）教育局，市直学校：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>根据《浙江省教育厅办公室关于做好<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年中小学教师省级培训工作的通知》（浙教办函〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>116</SPAN>号）要求，坚持“重心下移、按需组织、突出重点、分类施训”的原则，我市将组织实施<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年中小学教师省级培训工作，请各区、县（市）、市直学校根据文件要求做好<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年省级有关培训项目学员选拔、推荐和报名工作。现将有关事项通知如下：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "方正小标宋简体",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Verdana'>一、培训项目及名额分配</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 33.75pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>1.</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>“浙派名师名校长培养工程”项目，下达我市推荐名额<SPAN lang=EN-US>37</SPAN>名，其中：名师<SPAN lang=EN-US>31 </SPAN>名，名校长<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>名。我市采取等额推荐，根据各地培训需求调查反馈情况等进行名额分配，各区、县（市）、市直推荐名额详见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>、附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 33.75pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>2.</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>“长三角中小学名校长联合培训”项目，下达我市推荐名额<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>名，教育家型校长（中学）和小学校长各<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名。我市采取差额推荐，各区、县（市）至多各推荐上报<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>3.</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>中职学校骨干教师培训，教师登录“教师培训管理平台”按需报名。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "方正小标宋简体",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Verdana'>二、培训对象选拔推荐</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>1.</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>“浙派名师名校长培养工程”、“长三角中小学名校长联合培训”项目人选推荐的具体条件详见《浙江省教育厅办公室关于做好<SPAN lang=EN-US> 2019 </SPAN>年中小学教师省级培训工作的通知》（浙教办函〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>116</SPAN>号）文件（附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年起省级将实施“双名双特工程”，该两类名师名校长培养经历，将作为特级教师评审的前提条件，请各地务必高度重视学员选拔推荐工作。根据下达计划，严把选派条件，严格遴选程序，坚持公开、公平、择优原则，要向偏远地区、农村学校等的教师倾斜。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt">已参加过“浙派名师名校长培养工程</SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312'>” </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt"><FONT face=宋体>和</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312'>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt"><FONT face=宋体>长三角中小学名校长联合培训</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312'>”</SPAN><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt">者培训者不列入本期培养对象。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>3.</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>确定推荐人选后，填报相关培训对象个人推荐表和汇总表。市教育局对各地推荐上报的参训对象进行资格审查，对不符合参训条件的将取消参训资格，名额全市统筹。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "方正小标宋简体",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Verdana'>三、培训对象上报及选课程序</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>省级培训项目的上报、审核、选课等均通过平台进行。要严格按照时间要求，及时通知有关教师报名，督促所在学校和区、县（市）教育行政部门职能科室审核；对于已通过评审推荐的培训对象，要确保其按时间要求登录“平台”自主选择相关的培训机构和培训项目。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=16 style="MARGIN: 12pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "仿宋_GB2312",serif; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt'>具体操作办法详见《浙江省教育厅办公室关于做好<SPAN lang=EN-US> 2019 </SPAN>年中小学教师省级培训工作的通知》（浙教办函〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>116</SPAN>号）文件（附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Verdana",sans-serif'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
